  <file id="dialogs\randomevents\mc_wolo.txt" original="dialogs\randomevents\mc_wolo.txt">
    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::A man suddenly rushes towards you. He's already pointing his crossbow in your direction; weapon loaded - a finger on the trigger. Next to him, his pet, doesn't seem to react at all to what his owner is doing.::

Hop, hop, hop, argh! They're driving me derailed! ::He stomps the ground.:: I ran out of hunting mmm... hunting... *stuff*! Gimme yours, right now!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a3" name="=&gt;a3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Okay, hold on. What is the meaning of this?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm getting sick of hunting those little buggers with my bare hands! I'm out of my... my stuff! And my dog's doing little to help out. Argh! ::He's frustrated and still pointing his weapon towards you.:: Still, Shoogi is my new dog, and it's only a matter of time before he...before he wakes up, and tears apart those hoppers! ::He laughs.:: And all those who don't obey me.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a5" name="=&gt;a5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Okay, what do you need?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Anything that will help me catch those *hoppers*! Give me dog crates, nets, hell even better bolts for my weapon. I captured two of them and still need as much. ::He readjusts his aim, as his arms are slightly shaking. After that, he glances over to his pet.:: 

It's either that or we are taking you down!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a8" name="=&gt;a8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Before I give you anything, I need some information.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Ummm... fine, what is it?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a10" name="=&gt;a10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Have you seen someone pass through here? Newton is his name.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The name doesn't ring any bells. If anything, I did see some blood trails west from here. ::He shakes his head.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a12" name="=&gt;a12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Give him two of your dog crates.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q13" name="=&gt;q13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>There we go, I knew you had them with you. Wish I had brought those crates with me. Only if I knew it would be this hard ::he wipes his forehead.:: Now to finish the business. 

::He turns his back to you.:: And after I'm done, this place is yours.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a14" name="=&gt;a14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Give him the crates and watch him leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a15" name="=&gt;a15">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">30</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Give him two throwing nets.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q16" name="=&gt;q16">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">32</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Not the biggest fan of those. But... Fine, I'll take them. It's better than nothing. 

After I'm done with the damn hoppers, these hunting grounds are yours. ::He takes your throwing nets and prepares himself to use them.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a17" name="=&gt;a17">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">34</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Give him the throwing nets and watch him leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a18" name="=&gt;a18">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">36</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Give him two tranquilizing bolts.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q19" name="=&gt;q19">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">38</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Oh, you got those? Of course I'd like to have them. I'm quite capable with my crossbow, you know. ::He laughs.:: Come on Shoogi, time to finish the hunt ::The dog squeals.:: 

After we're done, I'm leaving this place to you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a20" name="=&gt;a20">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">40</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Give him the tranqulizing bolts and watch him leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a21" name="=&gt;a21">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">42</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>We could help each other catch the hoppers we need.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q22" name="=&gt;q22">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">44</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>W-what do you mean by that? ::He slightly lowers his crossbow.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a23" name="=&gt;a23">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">46</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>No need for hostilities. We can cooperate.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q24" name="=&gt;q24">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">48</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::He's taken back by what you've just said. He glances a few times back and forth between you and his pet.:: I... I suppose that could work.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a25" name="=&gt;a25">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">50</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Let's do it. ::Aid him in capturing the hoppers.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q26" name="=&gt;q26">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">52</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Even the dog questions this decision.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q27" name="=&gt;q27">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">54</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I... I suppose I have two companions now. Uhhh, sort of, heh heh. ::He makes a nervous laugh.:: I don't have much time so let's get this over with. Onto the hunt!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a28" name="=&gt;a28">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">56</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Proceed with catching the hoppers.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a29" name="=&gt;a29">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">58</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I got you now! ::Attack!::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a30" name="=&gt;a30">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">60</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I don't have anything I could offer you. Sorry.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q31" name="=&gt;q31">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">62</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Don't make me do this... I need to catch these hoppers. It will be with your stuff or... or with your c-corpse watching me do it. Shoogi, ::He points to the dog:: will make sure of the latter.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a32" name="=&gt;a32">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">64</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::[Intimidation]:: You wicked fool. With my bare hands, I've torn apart much larger beasts then you've even dreamed of. Get out of this place right now, or I'll make you and your dog squeal as I tear you apart, limb from limb.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q33" name="=&gt;q33">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">66</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Aah? Huh... I-I didn't mean it like that. ::He quickly lowers his weapon.:: O-okay. I'll leave, alright?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a34" name="=&gt;a34">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">68</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Get out of my sight.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a35" name="=&gt;a35">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">70</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Begone, fool.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a36" name="=&gt;a36">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">72</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Watch them leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q37" name="=&gt;q37">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">74</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm not afraid of you! Shoogi, get $(#him/her)!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a38" name="=&gt;a38">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">76</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Fight!::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a39" name="=&gt;a39">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">78</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Come and get me! ::Attack!::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a40" name="=&gt;a40">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">80</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm leaving, whether you like it or not.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q41" name="=&gt;q41">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">82</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I can't stand trying to hunt these buggers with my bare hand no more! ::He quickly turns his head to locate his pet. After that he faces you once again.:: No gain, you're prey! Get him, Shoogi!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a42" name="=&gt;a42">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">84</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Fight!::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a43" name="=&gt;a43">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">86</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::[Biology] or [Perception]:: I can see that your dog is quite old.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q44" name="=&gt;q44">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">88</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>What do you mean by that? I've bought it from a guy over at Junkyard. He told me that this one is one of the best! And he was at a huge discount, too! ::He quickly glanced back and forth between you and his pet.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a45" name="=&gt;a45">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">90</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Whoever sold you this scammed you. The reason why your dog is not helping you much is just because of that: He's old. &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q46" name="=&gt;q46">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">92</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Ah. what? I-I ::He stops for a moment and lowers his weapon. After that, he glances over to his companion.:: Impossible, I got played so hard! Aargh, what do I do now? ::He hysterically starts to rub his head.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a47" name="=&gt;a47">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">94</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It might be a matter of days before this dog passes away. While he's still with us, take him back to whomever you bought it from and ask for your money back. It's the best you can do.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q48" name="=&gt;q48">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">96</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Argh! ::He kicks a nearby rock into the lake.:: I had so many plans to do with... Shoogi. But... I don't see any other way. ::He shakes his head.:: Fine, fine! I will take him back. At least I can salvage something. ::He turns away from you.:: I-I'm sorry for all... this. Goodbye. 

::After that, he runs over to his pet and picks him up.:: Bad Shoogi, bad!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q49" name="=&gt;q49">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">98</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The dog makes some squealing noises.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a50" name="=&gt;a50">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">100</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Watch him leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a51" name="=&gt;a51">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">102</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::[Intimidation]:: You are shaking aren't you? I can see the fear in your eyes. If you don't leave this place at once, I'll make sure that this cave becomes your tomb. And then I'll unleash these hoppers to feed on your corpse!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a52" name="=&gt;a52">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">104</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::[Mercantile]:: I can offer you a deal.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q53" name="=&gt;q53">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">106</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>A deal? What is it?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a54" name="=&gt;a54">
